# Keep host build artifacts out of the image build context.
# Critically, backend/.venv must not be copied over the venv built by
# `uv sync` inside the image (its interpreter path is host-specific).
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/dist
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
.git
.github
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
